    "rules": [
      "3rd conjugation uses -i- as theme vowel (ducit, not *ducet)",
      "3rd person plural: 3rd conj = -unt, 4th conj = -iunt",
      "3rd-io verbs (capio) look like 4th conj in present tense",
      "Check the infinitive to identify the conjugation"
    ]
